	(text "U9 = TPS54360B (60V). EN is intentionally floating: internal 1.2uA pull-up.\nEN abs max is 8.4V - never tie EN to VSUP. D5 = required catch diode.\nComp re-designed for 484kHz, 3.28V, ~60uF Cout, fc ~20kHz: R31 7.5k, C29 12nF, C30 82pF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at -790.00 356.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9a1204d4-f2f1-4d0e-bfc1-fddd86cf129a")
	)
	(text "36V: U2-U5 are DRV8251A (no nFAULT/nSLEEP, internal charge pump).\nIPROPI gain 1575uA/A: R1/R11/R12/R21 = 1k -> ITRIP 2.10A, 1.575 V/A.\nThe FAULT net (U8 IO40, R28) no longer has a driver."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at -328.93 50.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d9cefe29-803d-4169-b523-deb4ff7738ff")
	)
