	(text "PHASE-CURRENT ADC (36V branch)\nSOx -> TLV9064 follower -> (a) 2.0k/1nF -> ESP32 ADC (same ~2us response as before)\n                       -> (b) 47R/1nF C0G -> ADS7038 (settles <0.3us, 12pF kickback recovered in tACQ)\nADS7038 ref = AVDD = 3V3: 0-3.3V span, ratiometric with the 3.3k/3.3k SOx bias (1.65V = 0A, 0.179 V/A).\nSPI on U10: IO37 CS (10k pull-up)  IO41 SCLK  IO42 SDI  IO46 SDO. IO46 is a strapping pin: SDO is\nhi-Z while CS is high, so the internal pull-down still sets it at reset. AIN6/AIN7 spare."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 457.20 289.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fba8524a-bb05-4b9b-b7b9-1384b8130144")
	)
